<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="panel"><div>${eyebrow("A practical place to begin")}<h2>Know what to ask before anyone starts cutting.</h2><p>A little preparation makes quotes clearer and gardens easier to maintain. Use our free seasonal and job-planning guides.</p><div class="button-row">${a("/guides/","Read the gardening guides","button")}</div></div><ul class="list-clean"><li>Plan around Christchurch seasons</li><li>Get the scope clear before a tidy-up</li><li>Understand access and waste removal</li><li>Compare quotes on like-for-like work</li></ul></div></div></section>
